# Tooling and build output. None of this belongs in the repository: it is either reproducible from source or
# machine-specific. The JVM crash logs are the interesting entry - a JavaFX media crash in this sandbox writes
# hs_err_pid*.log next to whatever was running, and it was being left untracked and unnoticed.
node_modules/
out/
classes/
*.log
hs_err_pid*.log
